      "side": 1,
      "message": "When do you plan to set this flag?  How much does it affect the performance of soong_zip when it is set for large zip files?\n\nI also wonder if this is the right place to do this.  Zip files are often modified after soong_zip, for example by merge_zips or zip2zip.  Should this be a standalone tool you can run on whatever the final form of the zip file is regardless of which tool created it?",
      "revId": "0e84d28463d3d6a41bc7799d32d7300c580ba81e",
