      "writtenOn": "2023-01-18T02:43:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Will only enable it to the final steps of generating some large zip files, e.g. host-unit-tests.zip, general-tests.zip, android-cts.zip etc. In my local workstation, generating manifest file costs extra 7~8 seconds when compressing `host-unit-tests`, which is a 20+GB directory. (13 seconds without the flag, and 20s with the flag)\n\nWe\u0027ll plan to support the feature in `merge_zips`. I haven\u0027t found zip2zip is used in our target cases so far.",
      "parentUuid": "636ad7fa_f0a56f2e",
      "revId": "0e84d28463d3d6a41bc7799d32d7300c580ba81e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
